.Dd October 8, 2026
.Dt UPTERM 1
.Os UP-Term
.Sh NAME
.Nm UPTerm
.Nd change a setting of the UP-Term window it runs in
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar name
.Op Ar value ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Every setting of UP-Term's menus and of its preferences is also a command
typed at the prompt as
.Ql / Ns Ar name Ar value
.Pq Li /cursor bar , /theme dracula-default , /font topaz 11 .
.Nm
does the same from a script, or in a window whose shell does its own line
editing:
.Dl UPTerm cursor bar
.Pp
The change applies to the window
.Nm
runs in;
.Li UPTerm save
writes the window's settings to its profile.
.Li /help
in the window lists the names, and Tab completes names and values.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 when the window took the setting, 10 when it refused it.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vsh 1
.Pp
The kit's README.txt, section COMMANDS.
